          "title": "Levy Lid Lift",
          "summary": "Under Resolution No. 2624, the City of Longview asks to raise its regular property tax rate by $1.15 per $1,000 of assessed value beginning in 2027 to fund fire and emergency medical response. The money would go to hiring firefighter paramedics/EMTs, replacing aging equipment, buying a fire engine, building an additional fire station, and related operations aimed at improving response times. The 2027 levy would become the base for calculating future levy limits.",
